  {
    "name": "clone_voice",
    "description": "声音复刻：用 voice-enrollment（action=create_voice）从一段录音创建自定义音色，返回 voice（音色 ID）。创建免费。\n- audio：本地文件、公网 http/https URL 或 Base64 Data URI（WAV 16bit/MP3/M4A，≤10MB，≥16kHz，推荐10–20秒、最长60秒，含至少5秒清晰朗读）。\n  本地文件编码为Data URI，直接放入官方input.audio，不经过临时上传；oss://未获官方确认，仍拒绝。\n- url：旧公网URL别名，不能与audio同时传；内部统一发送input.audio（官方input.url已逐步废弃）。\n- target_model：后续合成用的模型，默认 qwen-audio-3.0-tts-flash；可选 qwen-audio-3.1-tts-plus、qwen-audio-3.0-tts-plus、qwen-audio-3.1-tts-flash、\n  cosyvoice-v3.5-plus/v3.5-flash/v3-plus/v3-flash/v2。音色只能用于该模型。\n- prefix：音色名前缀，1–10 位字母或数字；音色 ID 形如 {target_model}-{prefix}-{唯一标识}。\n- language：样本语种代码（zh、en…，language_hints），cosyvoice-v2 不支持。\n- enable_preprocess（降噪增强）、max_prompt_audio_length（3–30 秒）：cosyvoice-v3-plus/v2 不支持。\n音色需审核：用 get_voice 确认 status=OK 后，再 text_to_speech(voice=音色ID) 合成。响应缺少音色 ID 时不自动重建。\n每个账号复刻/设计合计最多1000个音色。北京支持上述全部模型；新加坡支持3.1/3.0-tts-plus/flash和cosyvoice-v3-plus/flash。\n使用同地域API Key和workspace根域名；模型列出不代表账号授权。Qwen-Audio-Realtime协议尚未接入。\n",
    "inputSchema": {
      "properties": {
        "audio": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Audio"
        },
        "target_model": {
          "default": "qwen-audio-3.0-tts-flash",
          "title": "Target Model",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "prefix": {
          "default": "custom",
          "title": "Prefix",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "language": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Language"
        },
        "enable_preprocess": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Enable Preprocess"
        },
        "max_prompt_audio_length": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Max Prompt Audio Length"
        },
        "url": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Url"
        }
      },
      "title": "clone_voiceArguments",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "outputSchema": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["ok"],
      "properties": {
        "ok": {
          "type": "boolean"
        }
      },
      "additionalProperties": true
    },
    "annotations": {
      "readOnlyHint": false,
      "destructiveHint": false,
      "idempotentHint": false,
      "openWorldHint": true
    }
  },
  {
    "name": "design_voice",
    "description": "声音设计：用 voice-enrollment（action=create_voice）按文字描述创建音色，返回 voice（音色 ID）并保存试听音频。创建免费。\n- voice_prompt：声音描述，仅中英文，≤500 字符，如「沉稳的中年男性，语速缓慢，音色低沉有磁性」。描述声音特质，不要求模仿真人。\n- preview_text：试听文本，15–200 字符，中英文。\n- target_model：默认 qwen-audio-3.0-tts-flash；可选 qwen-audio-3.1-tts-plus、qwen-audio-3.0-tts-plus、qwen-audio-3.1-tts-flash、\n  cosyvoice-v3.5-plus/v3.5-flash/v3-plus/v3-flash。音色只能用于该模型。\n- prefix：1–10 位字母或数字；音色 ID 形如 {target_model}-vd-{prefix}-{唯一标识}。\n- language：zh 或 en，须与 preview_text 语种一致。sample_rate=16000/24000/48000，response_format=wav/mp3/pcm。\n音色 ID 先于试听文件记入本地任务；试听下载失败可用 recover_job 补交付，不会重新创建。设计带随机性，可多次生成择优。\n返回 job_id、job_state、artifacts、files、voice、target_model、error。北京地域能力。\n",
    "inputSchema": {
      "properties": {
        "voice_prompt": {
          "title": "Voice Prompt",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "preview_text": {
          "title": "Preview Text",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "target_model": {
          "default": "qwen-audio-3.0-tts-flash",
          "title": "Target Model",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "prefix": {
          "default": "custom",
          "title": "Prefix",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "language": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Language"
        },
        "sample_rate": {
          "default": 24000,
          "title": "Sample Rate",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "response_format": {
          "default": "wav",
          "title": "Response Format",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "out_dir": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Out Dir"
        }
      },
      "required": ["voice_prompt", "preview_text"],
      "title": "design_voiceArguments",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "outputSchema": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["ok"],
      "properties": {
        "ok": {
          "type": "boolean"
        }
      },
      "additionalProperties": true
    },
    "annotations": {
      "readOnlyHint": false,
      "destructiveHint": false,
      "idempotentHint": false,
      "openWorldHint": true
    }
  },
